<title>USA: Fargo Sch Dist Bldg Corp., N.D., won by Piper.</title>
<headline>Fargo Sch Dist Bldg Corp., N.D., won by Piper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $3.6 million of Fargo Sch. Dist. Bldg. Corporation, N.D., first mortgage revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.805 percent.</p>
</text>
